        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Andrea Martin, Mark Hoplamazian\n- Characters: Edith Prickley\n- Companies: Hyatt Hotels Corporation\n- Education: Harvard College, University of Chicago Booth School of Business\n- TV Shows: SCTV, Second City Television\n- Places: Melonville\n\nFacts:\n- Andrea Martin was born on January 15, 1947.\n- Andrea Martin is an American actress, singer, author, and comedian.\n- Andrea Martin is best known for her work in the television series SCTV.\n- Edith Prickley was created and portrayed by Andrea Martin.\n- Edith Prickley became the station manager of the fictional television station Second City Television.\n- Second City Television was based in the fictional city of Melonville and served the tri-city area.\n- Mark S. Hoplamazian is an American businessman.\n- Mark S. Hoplamazian is the President and CEO of Hyatt Hotels Corporation.\n- Mark S. Hoplamazian received an A.B. in economics from Harvard College.\n- Mark S. Hoplamazian received an M.B.A. from the University of Chicago Booth School of Business.",
